            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the form below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div>Kiwi Air Customer Complaint Form</div><p>Booking Details</p><ul><li>Name: Janet {{1}}</li><li>Ticket details: one adult and three children (Wellington to Christchurch) — four {{2}} tickets</li><li>Flight details: November 10th–15th</li><li>Time: departing at {{3}} am</li></ul><p>Details of the Problem</p><ul><li>the website changes the rate for one child</li><li>the website keeps giving the customer {{4}} messages</li></ul><p>Customer informed that Kiwi Air policy:</p><ul><li>allows no more than {{5}} child fares per adult (domestic flights only)</li></ul><p>Customer's Reasons for Complaint</p><ul><li>none of her children are {{6}} years old or older</li><li>child passengers require less {{7}}</li><li>the rule is unfair for large families and {{8}} groups</li></ul><p>Customer Invited to Send Written Complaint</p><ul><li>letter to go to the {{9}}</li><li>reply predicted within a week</li></ul><ul><li>Reference number: {{10}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 3
          }
        ]
      },
