                "number": 23,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What will Max and Izzy stress about attitudes to bicycles in the 20th century?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "The popularity of cars reduced the status of bicycles in the 1950s."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "New designs led to an increase in sales of bicycles in the 1960s."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "An interest in fitness promoted demand for bicycles in the 1980s."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 24,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Max say about a scheme to provide free bikes to school pupils?",
